B.alC=s(["The Logo startup screen now stays for about five seconds and can be skipped by tapping or clicking it.","Android production builds now use the dedicated Supabase-enabled build flow, fixing the demo-mode fallback after sign-in.","Android reminders now use the new, clearer cat sound."],t.s)
